%% End-to-end request pipeline.
%% Example: GET /v1/catalog/skills?q=devops from the buyer's browser.
%% Mirrors the middleware chain installed in apps/api/src/main.py.

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Browser as Buyer Browser
    participant CORS as CORSMiddleware
    participant Trace as TraceIdMiddleware
    participant Rate as slowapi Limiter
    participant Router as catalog.router
    participant Service as catalog.service
    participant ORM as SQLAlchemy 2.x async session
    participant PG as Postgres 16
    participant Log as structlog JSON
    participant Err as install_exception_handlers

    Note over Router: GET /v1/catalog/skills
    Note over Service: list_skills(filters)
    Note over PG: tables: skills, skill_versions, categories, reviews_agg
    Note over Log: every log line carries trace_id (via contextvar)
    Note over Err: handles AppError, HTTPException, RequestValidationError, Exception

    Browser->>CORS: GET /v1/catalog/skills?q=devops
    Note over Browser,CORS: Origin: http://localhost:3000
    CORS->>Trace: pass (allow_origins from settings.CORS_ORIGINS)
    Trace->>Trace: incoming X-Trace-Id or new uuid4().hex
    Note over Trace: set _trace_id_var (contextvar)
    Trace->>Rate: forward
    Rate->>Rate: key = user.id if request.state.user else remote IP
    Note over Rate: budget = LIMIT_DEFAULT = 120/min
    alt over budget
        Rate-->>Err: raise RateLimitExceeded
        Err-->>Browser: 429 ErrorResponse
        Note over Err,Browser: error.code = request.rate_limited, trace_id
    else under budget
        Rate->>Router: dispatch
        Router->>Router: parse Query() params -> CatalogFilters
        Note over Router: q, categories, sort, limit, cursor, ...
        Router->>Service: list_skills(session, filters)
        Service->>ORM: select(Skill).where(...).order_by(...).limit(N+1)
        ORM->>PG: SELECT ... FROM skills JOIN ...
        PG-->>ORM: rows[]
        ORM-->>Service: list[Skill]
        Service-->>Router: (items, PageInfo)
        Router-->>Trace: SkillCardPage Pydantic model
        Note over Router,Trace: FastAPI serialises to JSON
        Trace-->>CORS: response + X-Trace-Id header
        CORS-->>Browser: 200 application/json
        Note over CORS,Browser: X-Trace-Id: hex
    end

    Note over Service,PG: async session committed only on mutations. List endpoints do not write.
    Note over Err: AppError, HTTPException, RequestValidationError, and uncaught Exception all funnel through _render() and return ErrorResponse with fields error.code, error.message, error.details, error.trace_id, error.doc_url
